# Mol-1 inference dependencies, pinned to the upstream tested stack except for
# PyTorch: this family runs CUDA 12 (the A100 host driver predates CUDA 13), so
# it uses upstream's `cuda12` extra shape, torch 2.10 + cu12 operator wheels.
# Versions otherwise follow the upstream 7480cc4 requirements.txt; `click` is
# absent there but declared in pyproject.toml, and the CLI cannot start without
# it because the package installs with --no-deps.
